# 🧱 Virtualization Fundamentals

## What is Virtualization
Running multiple virtual computers on one physical machine.

## Why Virtualization
No need for separate servers for each software or system.

## Hypervisor
Virtualization layer managing virtual machines.  
Acts like a building manager allocating resources.

## Lab Machine (LM)
A virtual computer created inside a hypervisor.

## Containers
Lightweight environments running a single application.

## VM Components
CPU  
Memory  
Disk size

