# ☁️ Cloud Computing Fundamentals

## What is Cloud Computing
Using computing resources over the internet.

## Evolution of Cloud
Physical servers → virtualization → automation → cloud (AWS 2006) → modern era.

## Cloud Service Models
IaaS — infrastructure  
PaaS — platform  
SaaS — software

### Analogy
IaaS = empty apartment  
PaaS = semi‑furnished  
SaaS = hotel

## Cloud Characteristics
Scalability — ability to grow or shrink resources automatically.

## EC2
Amazon’s virtual machine service.

## Instance Type
Defines CPU, memory, and performance of a cloud VM.

## Cloud Deployment Models
Public — shared  
Private — dedicated  
Hybrid — mix of both

## “Up to Operating System”
In IaaS, customer manages everything from OS upward.

